flowchart TD
    A[Product line added to Sale or ServiceOrder] --> B{Reserve stock?}
    B -- No --> C[No reservation; available stock unchanged]
    B -- Yes --> D[Create InventoryReservation]
    D --> E[Increase reserved; on-hand unchanged]
    E --> F{Release reservation?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Release reservation]
    G --> H[Decrease reserved; on-hand unchanged]
    F -- No --> I{Business flow}
    C --> I
    H --> I
    I -- Sale --> J[Sale fully settled]
    I -- Service order --> K[Status becomes FIXED]
    K --> L[Keep reservation active]
    L --> M[Service balance reaches zero]
    J --> N[Consume active reservation; deduct any remaining quantity]
    M --> N
    N --> O[Decrease on-hand; create outbound InventoryMovement]
    O --> P[Later physical handover: PICKED]
    P --> Q{Later REFUNDED or CANCELLED?}
    Q -- No --> R[Stock remains consumed]
    Q -- Yes --> S[Operator selects returned product lines and quantities]
    S --> T[Create StockReturn + selected lines]
    T --> U[Increase stock for selected quantities only]

    V[Unpaid Sale/ServiceOrder cancelled] --> W[Release active reservations only]
    W --> X[No stock-in movement]
